ollow ugc noopener\">#1475</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added preview for country flags while editing <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1448\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1448</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added support for APCu caching method <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1442\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1442</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added support for attribute to ignoring auto spoilers opening <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1466\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1466</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Some enhancements <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1445\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1445</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Some cleanup...😣 <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1488\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1488</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data